{"real": true, "dur": 66.65, "sent": [{"start": 0.26, "end": 3.14, "text": "Now for the third step: filling the slots.", "words": [{"w": "Now", "s": 0.26}, {"w": "for", "s": 0.62}, {"w": "the", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "third", "s": 0.96}, {"w": "step:", "s": 1.3}, {"w": "filling", "s": 2.26}, {"w": "the", "s": 2.6}, {"w": "slots.", "s": 2.76}]}, {"start": 3.68, "end": 6.44, "text": "To start, here are the two courses side by side.", "words": [{"w": "To", "s": 3.68}, {"w": "start,", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "here", "s": 4.44}, {"w": "are", "s": 4.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 4.84}, {"w": "two", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "courses", "s": 5.22}, {"w": "side", "s": 5.72}, {"w": "by", "s": 5.98}, {"w": "side.", "s": 6.22}]}, {"start": 7.0, "end": 12.7, "text": "French follows L’Atelier: a welcome unit, then four themed units.", "words": [{"w": "French", "s": 7.0}, {"w": "follows", "s": 7.56}, {"w": "La-tuh-li-eh:", "s": 8.26}, {"w": "a", "s": 9.56}, {"w": "welcome", "s": 9.7}, {"w": "unit,", "s": 10.22}, {"w": "then", "s": 10.98}, {"w": "four", "s": 11.34}, {"w": "themed", "s": 11.72}, {"w": "units.", "s": 12.28}]}, {"start": 13.1, "end": 15.16, "text": "You can see their French titles here.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 13.1}, {"w": "can", "s": 13.22}, {"w": "see", "s": 13.48}, {"w": "their", "s": 13.68}, {"w": "French", "s": 13.9}, {"w": "titles", "s": 14.36}, {"w": "here.", "s": 14.88}]}, {"start": 16.14, "end": 25.36, "text": "Chinese, meanwhile, follows New Practical Chinese Reader, Book 1, with its fourteen lessons regrouped into five units.", "words": [{"w": "Chinese,", "s": 16.14}, {"w": "meanwhile,", "s": 17.08}, {"w": "follows", "s": 18.12}, {"w": "New", "s": 18.7}, {"w": "Practical", "s": 18.94}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 19.52}, {"w": "Reader,", "s": 20.02}, {"w": "Book", "s": 20.78}, {"w": "1,", "s": 21.28}, {"w": "with", "s": 21.88}, {"w": "its", "s": 22.12}, {"w": "fourteen", "s": 22.4}, {"w": "lessons", "s": 22.86}, {"w": "regrouped", "s": 23.48}, {"w": "into", "s": 24.06}, {"w": "five", "s": 24.42}, {"w": "units.", "s": 24.9}]}, {"start": 25.82, "end": 38.4, "text": "The French book names its situations, adds short workshops built around real documents, which it calls expression workshops, and ends each unit with a Mission.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 25.82}, {"w": "French", "s": 25.98}, {"w": "book", "s": 26.32}, {"w": "names", "s": 26.84}, {"w": "its", "s": 27.3}, {"w": "situations,", "s": 27.72}, {"w": "adds", "s": 29.24}, {"w": "short", "s": 29.8}, {"w": "workshops", "s": 30.14}, {"w": "built", "s": 30.86}, {"w": "around", "s": 31.22}, {"w": "real", "s": 31.7}, {"w": "documents,", "s": 31.98}, {"w": "which", "s": 32.84}, {"w": "it", "s": 33.14}, {"w": "calls", "s": 33.32}, {"w": "expression", "s": 34.1}, {"w": "workshops,", "s": 34.7}, {"w": "and", "s": 36.02}, {"w": "ends", "s": 36.26}, {"w": "each", "s": 36.7}, {"w": "unit", "s": 37.06}, {"w": "with", "s": 37.5}, {"w": "a", "s": 37.8}, {"w": "Mission.", "s": 38.02}]}, {"start": 38.84, "end": 43.24, "text": "So for French, I mostly split up and sorted what was already there.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 38.84}, {"w": "for", "s": 39.04}, {"w": "French,", "s": 39.28}, {"w": "I", "s": 40.14}, {"w": "mostly", "s": 40.26}, {"w": "split", "s": 40.78}, {"w": "up", "s": 41.12}, {"w": "and", "s": 41.48}, {"w": "sorted", "s": 41.68}, {"w": "what", "s": 42.1}, {"w": "was", "s": 42.32}, {"w": "already", "s": 42.58}, {"w": "there.", "s": 43.02}]}, {"start": 43.88, "end": 46.68, "text": "The Chinese book, however, has none of that.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 43.88}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 44.06}, {"w": "book,", "s": 44.54}, {"w": "however,", "s": 44.92}, {"w": "has", "s": 45.76}, {"w": "none", "s": 46.04}, {"w": "of", "s": 46.28}, {"w": "that.", "s": 46.46}]}, {"start": 47.28, "end": 50.26, "text": "So I have to write the Chinese situations myself.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 47.28}, {"w": "I", "s": 47.64}, {"w": "have", "s": 47.72}, {"w": "to", "s": 47.92}, {"w": "write", "s": 48.1}, {"w": "the", "s": 48.38}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 48.58}, {"w": "situations", "s": 49.02}, {"w": "myself.", "s": 49.72}]}, {"start": 50.76, "end": 52.74, "text": "Twenty-six of them in total.", "words": [{"w": "Twenty-six", "s": 50.76}, {"w": "of", "s": 51.58}, {"w": "them", "s": 51.78}, {"w": "in", "s": 52.08}, {"w": "total.", "s": 52.26}]}, {"start": 53.16, "end": 60.84, "text": "As for the tasks, lessons 6 and 14 are review lessons, so I use those as the basis for the final tasks.", "words": [{"w": "As", "s": 53.16}, {"w": "for", "s": 53.34}, {"w": "the", "s": 53.46}, {"w": "tasks,", "s": 53.6}, {"w": "lessons", "s": 54.72}, {"w": "6", "s": 55.38}, {"w": "and", "s": 55.52}, {"w": "14", "s": 55.7}, {"w": "are", "s": 56.22}, {"w": "review", "s": 56.34}, {"w": "lessons,", "s": 56.72}, {"w": "so", "s": 57.82}, {"w": "I", "s": 58.0}, {"w": "use", "s": 58.14}, {"w": "those", "s": 58.34}, {"w": "as", "s": 58.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 58.86}, {"w": "basis", "s": 59.02}, {"w": "for", "s": 59.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 60.02}, {"w": "final", "s": 60.16}, {"w": "tasks.", "s": 60.48}]}, {"start": 61.76, "end": 64.099, "text": "For the other units, I write the tasks too.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 61.76}, {"w": "the", "s": 61.88}, {"w": "other", "s": 62.04}, {"w": "units,", "s": 62.3}, {"w": "I", "s": 63.06}, {"w": "write", "s": 63.14}, {"w": "the", "s": 63.32}, {"w": "tasks", "s": 63.48}, {"w": "too.", "s": 63.84}]}, {"start": 64.72, "end": 66.06, "text": "Let me show you what that looks like.", "words": [{"w": "Let", "s": 64.72}, {"w": "me", "s": 64.84}, {"w": "show", "s": 64.98}, {"w": "you", "s": 65.18}, {"w": "what", "s": 65.26}, {"w": "that", "s": 65.44}, {"w": "looks", "s": 65.6}, {"w": "like.", "s": 65.82}]}]}